Fix precision loss in bid/ask/ref asymmetry check, bump optimizer_runs (#88)

Replace the rounded-ratio-and-reciprocal check in
_validateBidAskReferencePriceX64 with an exact cross-multiplication
comparison, avoiding false BidAskRefAsymmetryOutOfBounds reverts on
valid quotes near the asymmetry boundary. Bump optimizer_runs to 1999
(from 1933), the highest value that still fits MetricOmmPoolDeployer
under the EIP-170 size limit.